    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy packing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Simulation</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/text-justification/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 68</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Text Justification</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Hard only in bookkeeping: pack each line greedily (letters + one space per gap &lt;= maxWidth), then split the free spaces with divmod over the gaps, giving the remainder to the leftmost gaps. The last line and single-word lines are left-justified and padded. O(total characters) time.</p>\n"
